{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the footsteps of the King's castle is his most loved winter town. You are one of the last line of defense - the Knight watch.<br>By day, you build walls, traps, place towers.<br>By night, you fight endless waves of monsters - undead, zombies, werewolves, wraiths, witches and other creatures of the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>KnightWatch</strong>, every sunrise is earned through blood and grit. Build smart, fight hard, and adapt with each passing night in this <strong>first-person tower defense roguelike</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build by Day</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct defenses, walls, traps, towers and upgrade those buildings. Every decision matters; what you build in the day determines if you'll survive the night.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend by Night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up and pick up your favorite weapon to fight off monsters of the night. Defend not just the town but also the towers you built during the day.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>unique blend</strong> of FPS combat, tower defense, and roguelike progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day\u2013night gameplay loop</strong>: build, defend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple enemy types</strong>: zombies, werewolves, wraiths, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple</strong>\u00a0<strong>weapons</strong>: swords, hammers, and crossbows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural waves and random upgrades</strong> for replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric PS2-inspired Pixel 3D art art style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3783840?t=1771132016","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3783840?t=1771132016","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783840/db06629f483632b4f7dae73ca9df0f3ef0106199/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771132016","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783840/db06629f483632b4f7dae73ca9df0f3ef0106199/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771132016","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game has violence and fighting against fantasy and fictional monsters using weapons like swords, bow and arrow."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the footsteps of the King's castle is his most loved winter town. You are one of the last line of defense - the Knight watch.<br>By day, you build walls, traps, place towers.<br>By night, you fight endless waves of monsters - undead, zombies, werewolves, wraiths, witches and other creatures of the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>KnightWatch</strong>, every sunrise is earned through blood and grit. Build smart, fight hard, and adapt with each passing night in this <strong>first-person tower defense roguelike</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build by Day</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct defenses, walls, traps, towers and upgrade those buildings. Every decision matters; what you build in the day determines if you'll survive the night.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend by Night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up and pick up your favorite weapon to fight off monsters of the night. Defend not just the town but also the towers you built during the day.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>unique blend</strong> of FPS combat, tower defense, and roguelike progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day\u2013night gameplay loop</strong>: build, defend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple enemy types</strong>: zombies, werewolves, wraiths, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple</strong>\u00a0<strong>weapons</strong>: swords, hammers, and crossbows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural waves and random upgrades</strong> for replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric PS2-inspired Pixel 3D art art style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["SeaWalkGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783840/1a279c1a561bc7130609475df00b56220548fe55/header.jpg?t=1771132016","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"This intellectual property and all trademarks and copyrights belong to and are protected under the company name Mayawi Software OPC Pvt Ltd","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamsta